{"id":"cf7dbabb97c0679f","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-finite-model-property.md","title":"Finite Model Property","display":"df-finite-model-property — Finite Model Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-finite-model-property","aliases":["89-df-finite-model-property","finite model property","有限模型性质","FMP"],"display":"df-finite-model-property — Finite Model Property","depends_on":["[[89-df-kripke-model]]","[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","[[89-df-finite]]","[[89-df-valid-modal]]","[[89-df-kripke-frame]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-finite-model-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-finite-model-property</span><span>finite model property</span><span>有限模型性质</span><span>FMP</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-finite-model-property — Finite Model Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ab746eb779e20ce0\" href=\"?note=ab746eb779e20ce0\" title=\"89-df-kripke-model\">89-df-kripke-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9cd755e57aea2c47\" href=\"?note=9cd755e57aea2c47\" title=\"89-df-finite\">89-df-finite</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dbba58e7bd3b0667\" href=\"?note=dbba58e7bd3b0667\" title=\"89-df-valid-modal\">89-df-valid-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c78d4bf1505bda5c\" href=\"?note=c78d4bf1505bda5c\" title=\"89-df-kripke-frame\">89-df-kripke-frame</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-finite-model-property-—-Finite-Model-Property-(FMP)\">df-finite-model-property — Finite Model Property (FMP)</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> is the predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9cd755e57aea2c47\" href=\"?note=9cd755e57aea2c47\" title=\"89-df-finite\">89-df-finite</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KFrame}\">\\(\\mathrm{KFrame}\\)</span> is the well-formed-frame predicate from\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c78d4bf1505bda5c\" href=\"?note=c78d4bf1505bda5c\" title=\"89-df-kripke-frame\">89-df-kripke-frame</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FMP}(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{FMP}(L)\\)</span> 是下述定义的一元有限模型性质谓词，参数为模态公式集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}model\\text{-}property}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FMP}(L)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n(A\\notin L\\to\n\\exists W,R\\;\n(\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(W)\n\\land\\forall B\\in L\\;((W,R)\\models B)\n\\land(W,R)\\not\\models A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}model\\text{-}property}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FMP}(L)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n(A\\notin L\\to\n\\exists W,R\\;\n(\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(W)\n\\land\\forall B\\in L\\;((W,R)\\models B)\n\\land(W,R)\\not\\models A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>FMP : 有限模型性质</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> : 模态逻辑</li>\n</ul>\n<p>有限模型性质是模态逻辑的重要性质：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>对递归可枚举且有限模型检验有效的逻辑，FMP 与有效的有限反模型搜索\n合起来可推出可判定性；FMP 单独不蕴含可判定性</li>\n<li>FMP 提供&quot;小反例&quot;的存在性</li>\n<li>FMP 是许多模态逻辑的共同特征</li>\n</ul>\n<p>FMP的意义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>不有效公式有&quot;有限证据&quot;</li>\n<li>可以用算法寻找反模型</li>\n<li>FMP 本身不提供固定的复杂度上界</li>\n</ul>\n<p>有FMP的逻辑：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>K, T, K4, S4, S5（通过过滤技术证明）</li>\n<li>GL（需要特殊证明，因为过滤可能破坏逆良基性）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>GL的特殊情况：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>GL框架需要逆良基性</li>\n<li>过滤可能破坏逆良基性</li>\n<li>但GL仍有有限模型性质（需要特殊证明）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>相关概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"170626a7dad88370\" href=\"?note=170626a7dad88370\" title=\"89-df-filtration\">89-df-filtration</a>：证明FMP的技术</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"dbba58e7bd3b0667\" href=\"?note=dbba58e7bd3b0667\" title=\"89-df-valid-modal\">89-df-valid-modal</a>：FMP关于有效性</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"c922518c30c4107d\" href=\"?note=c922518c30c4107d\" title=\"89-df-canonical-model\">89-df-canonical-model</a>：典范模型（通常无限）</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a>：GL的特殊情况</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"f4b51513503cf1c0\" href=\"?note=f4b51513503cf1c0\" title=\"89-thm-fmp-gl\">89-thm-fmp-gl</a>：GL的FMP定理</li>\n</ul>\n<p>来源：Boolos，第 5 章 pp.78–84；本条给出一般 FMP 接口，GL 的具体界见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"b47f1c6b1cd23b5e\" href=\"?note=b47f1c6b1cd23b5e\" title=\"89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel\">89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-finite-model-property-—-Finite-Model-Property-(FMP)","text":"df-finite-model-property — Finite Model Property (FMP)","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"ab746eb779e20ce0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-satisfaction-modal","status":"resolved","id":"9f00301866fbd6f0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"9cd755e57aea2c47","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-finite]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-valid-modal","status":"resolved","id":"dbba58e7bd3b0667","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-valid-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c78d4bf1505bda5c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"9cd755e57aea2c47","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Finite}$ is the predicate from [[89-df-finite]].","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c78d4bf1505bda5c","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{KFrame}$ is the well-formed-frame predicate from\n[[89-df-kripke-frame]].","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-filtration","status":"resolved","id":"170626a7dad88370","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[89-df-filtration]]：证明FMP的技术","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-valid-modal","status":"resolved","id":"dbba58e7bd3b0667","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[89-df-valid-modal]]：FMP关于有效性","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-canonical-model","status":"resolved","id":"c922518c30c4107d","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[89-df-canonical-model]]：典范模型（通常无限）","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]：GL的特殊情况","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-fmp-gl","status":"resolved","id":"f4b51513503cf1c0","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[89-thm-fmp-gl]]：GL的FMP定理","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel","status":"resolved","id":"b47f1c6b1cd23b5e","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"来源：Boolos，第 5 章 pp.78–84；本条给出一般 FMP 接口，GL 的具体界见 [[89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KFrame}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FMP}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}model\\text{-}property}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FMP}(L)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n(A\\notin L\\to\n\\exists W,R\\;\n(\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(W)\n\\land\\forall B\\in L\\;((W,R)\\models B)\n\\land(W,R)\\not\\models A)).","display":true},{"tex":"L","display":false}],"bytes":2236,"backlinks":[{"id":"74c9df4215ffa321","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"FMP : 有限模型性质 (see [[89-df-finite-model-property]])"},{"id":"f4b51513503cf1c0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FMP}(\\mathrm{GL})$ is the predicate from\n[[89-df-finite-model-property]]."},{"id":"1b619488086561ea","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"GL具有有限模型性质 (see [[89-df-finite-model-property]])"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-220","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-finite-model-property]]"}],"outgoing":["ab746eb779e20ce0","9f00301866fbd6f0","9cd755e57aea2c47","dbba58e7bd3b0667","c78d4bf1505bda5c","170626a7dad88370","c922518c30c4107d","0006800fa1c85177","f4b51513503cf1c0","b47f1c6b1cd23b5e"]}